 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Months come in twelves, just as hours do. This means that months can be calculated using modulo 12, just like hours. For the following exercises, calculate what month it will be for each exercise.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505624,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Micaela works for a sprinkler maintenance company and runs a routine check on the Harris's sprinkler system every third month. If Micaela checks the system in an April, what month will it be when Micaela returns to the Harris's for the 11th time after that?",
